## 1. System Architecture Overview

| Component | Location / Setting | Details |
|---|---|---|
| **Cluster** | TAMU HPRC Grace (`grace.hprc.tamu.edu`) | RHEL 8.10 host, SLURM batch scheduler |
| **Login Nodes** | `grace1` – `grace5` | Shared CPU head nodes. **No heavy compute, no GPU.** |
| **GPU Compute Node** | `r001` (or allocated node) | 2x NVIDIA Quadro RTX 6000 (24 GB VRAM each), 48 CPU cores, 384 GB RAM |
| **Web Portal** | `portal-grace.hprc.tamu.edu` | Open OnDemand TurboVNC GUI session |
| **Singularity SIF** | `/sw/hprc/sw/bio/containers/isaac-sim/isaac-sim_5.1.0.sif` | Ubuntu 24.04 noble container with Isaac Sim 5.1.0 |
| **User Scratch** | `/scratch/user/jacob.dannie.am/` | 1.0 TB limit, 400,000 file limit |
| **User Home** | `/home/jacob.dannie.am/` | **10.0 GB limit, 10,000 file limit** (Strict!) |

