## 2. Strict Cluster Rules & Storage Quotas

> [!CAUTION]
> **NEVER write caches, datasets, or run containers in `$HOME` (`/home/jacob.dannie.am`)!**
> The quota is strictly 10 GB and 10,000 files. NVIDIA Omniverse Kit generates thousands of shader cache files. If Isaac Sim writes to `~/.nvidia-omniverse` or `~/.cache`, your account will hit `Disk quota exceeded` and lock your session immediately.

* **Always work in `$SCRATCH`**:
  ```bash
  cd $SCRATCH
  ```
* **Verify quotas**:
  ```bash
  showquota
  ```
* **Internet access on compute nodes**: Compute nodes (`r001`) have no external internet routing by default. To enable package downloads or web requests:
  ```bash
  module load WebProxy
  ```

