## 4. The Critical Container Rule: Why Native Host Execution Fails

> [!WARNING]
> Do **NOT** run `my_isaac_sim/isaac-sim/isaac-sim.sh` directly on the host!
> Grace runs Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8 (`glibc 2.28`). Isaac Sim 5.1.0 binaries (`kit`) require `glibc 2.34` (Ubuntu 22.04+). Running natively on the host fails with:
> `kit: /lib64/libc.so.6: version 'GLIBC_2.34' not found`
> Every Isaac Sim command **must** run through `singularity exec`.

