## 7. Troubleshooting & FAQ

| Error Encountered | Root Cause | Solution |
|---|---|---|
| `GLIBC_2.34 not found` | Script executed on Grace host instead of inside container. | Wrap command in `singularity exec --nv ...`. |
| `GLFW initialization failed` | `DISPLAY` variable not exported or pointing to wrong display. | Run `ps -u $USER -o pid,cmd \| grep Xvnc`, find display `:N`, and run `export DISPLAY=:N`. |
| `FileNotFoundError: material_cache.json` | Singularity `.sif` is read-only; Kit cannot create `/isaac-sim/kit/cache/...`. | Pass `--writable-tmpfs` and `--bind $SCRATCH/cache:/isaac-sim/kit/cache`. |
| `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'pxr'` | `from pxr import ...` called before `SimulationApp` initializes. | Call `from isaacsim import SimulationApp; app = SimulationApp({"headless": True})` at the top of the script. |
| Online 3D viewer rejects `.usd` | Stage only had `Points` or was in binary Crate 0.9.0. | Use `drone_course_sim_ready_2.usd` (has polygonal `Mesh`) or `drone_course_sim_ready_2.usdz`. |
